"The staff dorm is a narrow, unsigned three-story building on the outskirts of LeafSong's campus."
"It has exterior and interior elevators."
"Its first floor houses tmithans and feels like a dry sauna."
"Its second floor houses lortch and is pitch black and full of clicking."
"Its third floor houses the human staff and is air conditioned."
"The human floor's lockers show each user's name; the System alerts owners if one is opened."
"Humans sleep in soundproof capsule pods stacked two high, each a bit bigger than a double bed."
"Each pod has a privacy panel, reading lamp, shelf, sleeping pills and a false-sunrise alarm."
"The human floor has a long table with a cushioned bench, power adaptors and a laundry machine."
"Its bathroom has pale green tiles, toilet closets and four three-cycle shower stalls."
"A bathroom storage closet holds Manon's cooler, snacks and a dusty wevvi dispenser."
